Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Set 10 Nightmare (Abysscraft), analysis line: Diligent
 Undertaker, Vengeful Capra, Runaway Souls, Solemn Gravekeeper, Restive
 Centaur, Last Will and Testament, Attending Amanuensis, Nocturne's
 Interrogation (X = clues; then all allied Clue amulets banished; no damage at
 X = 0), Nocturne, Gremory and its crest scripted, out of PENDING; the three
 "allied card banished during your turn" cards on on_card_banished (amulets
 count; a Ghost's end-of-turn banish is still your turn); EN and CHS text
 checked; 12 tests, 33 of 33 mutants caught; 300 random games play out

